# This directory is a local archival copy of PONI experiment evidence.
# Track compact metrics, manifests, and diagnostics; keep raw logs and
# TensorBoard files local. Hashes and provenance live in objectnav/manifests/.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!runs/
!runs/**/
!runs/**/merged_results.txt
!runs/**/run_manifest.json
!runs/**/*_diagnostics.json
!runs/**/stats.json
